From: Project Luma
Subject: [PATCH] theme: token-derived, focus-invariant window elevation

The actual toolkit decoration owner draws three shadows and an independent
inset stroke. GTK computes native surface extents. Inner islands are unchanged.

--- a/src/stylesheet/widgets/_window.scss
+++ b/src/stylesheet/widgets/_window.scss
@@ -1,81 +1,103 @@
 window {
   &.csd {
